@CustomerManagement.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5215
@AgentRole = agent
@CustomerId = 75F05A60-4505-47BB-8D26-F2530D30C440
@RowVersion = AAAAAAAAJx4=
@AttachmentId = 86381386-a98b-40ac-82e8-a4301aa93005
@MissingCustomerId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@NonAgentRole = viewer

### Health check (DB)
GET {{CustomerManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/health/db
Accept: application/json

###

### Get customer interaction history (Story 03 - Task 2/3/4)
### Default pagination applies when page/pageSize are omitted.
GET {{CustomerManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/customers/{{CustomerId}}/interaction-history
Accept: application/json
X-User-Role: {{AgentRole}}

###

### Get customer interaction history with pagination (Story 03 - Task 3)
GET {{CustomerManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/customers/{{CustomerId}}/interaction-history?page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json
X-User-Role: {{AgentRole}}

###

### Get customer interaction history filtered by channel and direction (Story 03 - Task 4)
GET {{CustomerManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/customers/{{CustomerId}}/interaction-history?channel=email&direction=inbound
Accept: application/json
X-User-Role: {{AgentRole}}

###

### Get customer interaction history with alternate normalized channel value (Story 03 - Task 4)
GET {{CustomerManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/customers/{{CustomerId}}/interaction-history?channel=livechat&direction=outbound
Accept: application/json
X-User-Role: {{AgentRole}}

###

### Invalid interaction history filter should return 400 validation problem (Story 03 - Task 4)
GET {{CustomerManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/customers/{{CustomerId}}/interaction-history?channel=fax
Accept: application/json
X-User-Role: {{AgentRole}}

###

### Missing customer interaction history should return 404 (Story 03 - Task 2)
GET {{CustomerManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/customers/{{MissingCustomerId}}/interaction-history
Accept: application/json
X-User-Role: {{AgentRole}}

###

### Forbidden role should return 403 (Story 03 - Task 5)
GET {{CustomerManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/customers/{{CustomerId}}/interaction-history
Accept: application/json
X-User-Role: {{NonAgentRole}}

###

### Missing auth header should return 401 (Story 03 - Task 5)
GET {{CustomerManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/customers/{{CustomerId}}/interaction-history
Accept: application/json

###

### Add customer note (Story 02 - Task 2)
POST {{CustomerManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/customers/{{CustomerId}}/notes
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Role: {{AgentRole}}

{
  "body": "Customer called and confirmed receipt of onboarding email."
}

###

### List customer notes (Story 02 - Task 2)
GET {{CustomerManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/customers/{{CustomerId}}/notes
Accept: application/json
X-User-Role: {{AgentRole}}

###

### Upload customer attachment (Story 02 - Task 3)
### Keep content type in the allowed list configured in appsettings.json.
POST {{CustomerManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/customers/{{CustomerId}}/attachments
Accept: application/json
X-User-Role: {{AgentRole}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=UploadBoundary

--UploadBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="note-2.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Sample attachment content for customer record -v2.
--UploadBoundary--

###

### List customer attachments (Story 02 - Task 4)
GET {{CustomerManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/customers/{{CustomerId}}/attachments
Accept: application/json
X-User-Role: {{AgentRole}}

###

### Download customer attachment content (Story 02 - Task 5)
### Replace AttachmentId with an id from the list attachments response.
GET {{CustomerManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/customers/{{CustomerId}}/attachments/{{AttachmentId}}/content
X-User-Role: {{AgentRole}}

###

### Create customer profile
POST {{CustomerManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/customers
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Role: {{AgentRole}}

{
  "name": "Aya Saber",
  "company": "Contoso",
  "contactDetails": [
    {
      "channel": 1,
      "value": "aya@contoso.com",
      "label": "work",
      "isPrimary": true
    },
    {
      "channel": 6,
      "value": "+201234567890",
      "label": "mobile",
      "isPrimary": true
    }
  ]
}

###

### Get customer profile by id
GET {{CustomerManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/customers/{{CustomerId}}
Accept: application/json
X-User-Role: {{AgentRole}}

###

### Get customer contact details by id
GET {{CustomerManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/customers/{{CustomerId}}/contact-details
Accept: application/json
X-User-Role: {{AgentRole}}

###

### Update customer profile by id
PUT {{CustomerManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/customers/{{CustomerId}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Role: {{AgentRole}}

{
  "name": "Aya Saber Updated",
  "company": "Contoso Support",
  "rowVersion": "{{RowVersion}}",
  "contactDetails": [
    {
      "channel": 1,
      "value": "aya.updated@contoso.com",
      "label": "work",
      "isPrimary": true
    }
  ]
}

###
